<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Alpharma Inc and Raychem Corp were not avialable for after hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that Corimon SACA was also unavialable for trade after hours.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Alpharma said it expects to report breakeven earnings, or a slight loss, for the third quarter and that it sees net income in the fourth quarter lower than the previous fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Raychem said it will book a pre-tax gain of $23 million in its first quarter on the sale of a portfolio of patents and intellectual property.</p>
</text>
